<title>BELGIUM: ATHLETICS-KENYAN KOMEN SETS WORLD BEST TIME FOR TWO MILES.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-KENYAN KOMEN SETS WORLD BEST TIME FOR TWO MILES.</headline>
<dateline>HECHTEL, Belgium 1997-07-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Daniel Komen of Kenya set a world best time for two miles when he clocked seven minutes 58.61 seconds in an international meeting on Saturday.</p>
<p>Komen beat the previous time of 8:01.08 set by Ethiopia's Haile Gebrselassie at Hengelo in the Netherlands on May 31.</p>
